  "id": "ismip/ismip7-ais-forcing",
  "title": "ISMIP7 Antarctic Ice Sheet Forcing",
  "description": "Atmospheric and oceanic forcing data for Antarctic ice sheet models prepared for the ISMIP7 project. Includes downscaled CESM2-WACCM and MRI-ESM2-0 climate model outputs under control, historical, and multiple SSP scenarios at 2 km and 8 km resolution, plus ocean forcing, reanalysis-driven forcing, fracture fields, and ISMIP7 grid definitions.",
